Being a **HVAC Technical Support technician** means putting your passion and expertise to work for both the team and our customers.
As a **HVAC Technical Support Technician**, you will be responsible for responding to service requests, performing remote troubleshooting, and working closely with service technicians and teh R\&D team to support repair and preventive maintenance activities.
In this role, you will,* Respond to service calls and emails;
* Remotely monitor, locate, and diagnose technical issues;
* Recommend solutions that best meet customer needs;
* Read and interpret drawings and technical documentations;
* Enter orders into the internal system and follow up on shilpping confirmations;
* Work closely with the R\&D team to resolve technical issues;
* Process merchandise returns;
* Handle warranty and claim credits.
 **You’re the person we’re looking for if you have:**

* A diploma in Refrigeration, Building Mechanics, or a related field;
* Approximately 2 years of customer service experience;
* Experience or knowledge in heat pump systems (mini\-splits), considered a strong asset;
* Fluency in French and functional English to support English\-speaking customers;
* Strong computer skills and proficiency with Microsoft Office applications;
* General knowledge of the HVAC industry;
* An interest in troubleshooting and problem\-solving;
* The ability to work independently, with attention to detail, resourcefulness, and versatility;
* Excellent interpersonal skills and a professional attitude;
* Strong teamwork and collaboration skills.

